OL,3,GNEWSA'Difficulty' obtaining information
OL,4,Ainto dad's Benidorm death, coroner says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has spoken of the
OL,7,F"difficulty" obtaining information from
OL,8,FSpanish authorities about the death of
OL,9,Fa 30-year-old man in Benidorm.
OL,11,FNathan Osman's body was found at the
OL,12,Ffoot of a 200m cliff outside the resort
OL,13,Fin September 2024 less than 24 hours
OL,14,Fafter arriving on the island, where he
OL,15,Fhad been spending a night out with
OL,16,Ffriends.
OL,18,FAt a pre-inquest review in Pontypridd,
OL,19,FSouth Wales Police told the coroner
OL,20,Fthat they had requested information on
OL,21,Fa "number of occasions" without
OL,22,Fsuccess.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
