OL,3,GNEWSA'Difficulty' obtaining information
OL,4,Ainto dad's Benidorm death, coroner says
OL,5,
OL,6,FOsman's family believe foul play may
OL,7,Fhave been involved and have carried out
OL,8,Ftheir own investigations after saying
OL,9,Fthey were unsatisfied with the
OL,10,Fperformance of Spanish authorities.
